# Vite files
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
.vite/

# SymbolWright local runtime state — the whole directory is per-workspace runtime data (delegated
# access grants/credentials/sessions/audit history, orchestration state, missions, checkpoints,
# sandbox history, memory, config overrides, etc.), never repo content. Ignore it wholesale rather
# than itemizing subdirectories one at a time, since a forgotten subdirectory here is a real path to
# committing security-sensitive state (see docs/security/DELEGATED_AGENT_ACCESS.md). If a
# subdirectory ever needs to ship an intentionally versioned template, allowlist that specific file
# with a `!` pattern rather than removing this line.
.symbolwright/

# Legacy .codemind state dir (pre-rebrand runtime state; read only by
# migrateLegacyStateDir for one-time migration, never written to — must
# never be committed)
.codemind/
pr-*-starter-*.patch
